# The public video package contains Skills and workflow only. Personal projects,
# source media, renders, references, and old local migrations stay on this Mac.
/视频项目/
/旧版项目/
/本地项目/
/动效库/
/视觉规范与参考/
/临时输出/
/迁移清单.md

